        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/seesome/{size}/2018_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-09T18:16:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>\n<div>Since I love the video game's new opening pages, I wanted to see what all of the characters had to say. &nbsp;Collected here are all of the standard and nemesis quotes for anyone who's interested:</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>VILLAIN QUOTES</div>\n<div><span>Baron Blade: Tremble, fools! The moon grows closer with your every breath!</span></div>\n<div>Baron Blade (Mad Bomber): My bombs are scattered everywhere! You cannot win.</div>\n<div>Citizen Dawn: The world belongs to the Citizens of the Sun!</div>\n<div>Grand Warlord Voss: Cower before the might of the Thorathian conquering fleet!*&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Omnitron: Offensive Programming Online. Destroy Humans.</div>\n<div>Omnitron (Cosmic): Power Source: Unknown. Directive: Destroy.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><span>HERO QUOTES</span></div>\n<div><span>Absolute Zero: Tempers are running hot. Time to cool things down!</span></div>\n<div>Bunker: Work together, team! Think tactically and protect your teammates.&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Bunker (GI): I may be just a soldier, but you’re still going down!</div>\n<div>Fanatic: Repent, evildoer! You cannot stand against divine might!</div>\n<div>Haka: Haha! Battle! This will be fun!</div>\n<div>Legacy: We fight this day for liberty and for justice!</div>\n<div>Legacy (Young): We fight for what’s right! Gotta make dad proud!</div>\n<div>Ra: You shall burn under the baleful gaze of the sun!</div>\n<div>Tachyon: No time to waste! Let’s see how fast we can make this.</div>\n<div>Tachyon (Super-Scientific): A quandary! Time for some scientific action!</div>\n<div>Tempest: You face the strength of the storm. Face the maelstrom!</div>\n<div>Visionary: I have foreseen the consequences of this conflict.</div>\n<div>Wraith: The shadows strike as The Wraith! Stand down, villain!&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Wraith (Rook City): Preliminary investigations have shown this will be a tough fight.</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>NEMESIS QUOTE PAIRS:</div>\n<div><span>Baron Blade: At last! The destruction of my greatest foe is at hand! Legacy shall fall!</span></div>\n<div>Legacy: Stand down, Baron! The price of your hatred should not be the entire planet!</div>\n<div>--</div>\n<div>Baron Blade: Yet another blasted Legacy! Will there be no end to your terrible line?</div>\n<div>Young Legacy: You couldn’t defeat my father, and you’ll find me just as tough!</div>\n<div>--</div>\n<div>Mad Bomber Blade: If I cannot destroy you, Legacy, I will destroy all that you love!&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Legacy: Stop the madness, Blade! You threaten the lives of the innocent!</div>\n<div>--</div>\n<div>Mad Bomber Blade: You think yourself so clever. Your father knew to fear me. You shall learn...</div>\n<div><span>Young Legacy: You’re crazier than you are dangerous... and you’re really dangerous!&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div>--</div>\n<div>Grand Warlord Voss: Ah, the puny being who escaped me on Vognild Prime! Ready for your shackles?&nbsp;</div>\n<div>Tempest: You shall not ruin this planet the way you did my home! Your tyranny ends here!</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>* There's a typo in this one: conquering is spelled conquerering</div>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
