iv>NEMESIS QUOTE PAIRS:</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Baron Blade: At last! The destruction of my greatest foe is at hand! Legacy shall fall!</span></div><div>Legacy: Stand down, Baron! The price of your hatred should not be the entire planet!</div><div>--</div><div>Baron Blade: Yet another blasted Legacy! Will there be no end to your terrible line?</div><div>Young Legacy: You couldn&rsquo;t defeat my father, and you&rsquo;ll find me just as tough!</div><div>--</div><div>Mad Bomber Blade: If I cannot destroy you, Legacy, I will destroy all that you love!&nbsp;</div><div>Legacy: Stop the madness, Blade! You threaten the lives of the innocent!</div><div>--</div><div>Mad Bomber Blade: You think yourself so clever. Your father knew to fear me. You shall learn...</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Young Legacy: You&rsquo;re crazier than you are dangerous... and you&rsquo;re really dangerous!&nbsp;</span></div><div>--</div><div>Grand Warlord Voss: Ah, the puny being who escaped me on Vognild Prime! Ready for your shackles?&nbsp;</div><div>Tempest: You shall not ruin this planet the way you did my home! Your tyranny ends here!</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>* There&#39;s a typo in this one: conquering is spelled conquerering</div></div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
