        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/76d3ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-11T07:23:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The first time I went up against Mad Bomber Blade I had Young Legacy as the leader. Realizing that the quotes were nemesis specific (and even variant specific!) was a really nice moment.</p><p>Then I lost, horribly. Although, I'll also say that I was very impressed with how incredibly thematic the Legacy machanics felt with her up against Blade.</p>",
